        {
          "code": "BP2",
          "text": "The kernel-only start (decision 20) differs from the real initial state in two ways with opposite effects: it ignores the inventory already outside the SiC (raises F_p) and the inventory already in the coatings (lowers F_p). The size of the difference is not stated here: the results pipeline computes it for Sr-90 and Cs-137 from the Scenario 5 heating runs against the kernel-only runs of the same histories and writes it into the files curves/s5.refuelling.heating*.json, field kernel_only_comparison. The net direction is not established for Ag-110m and Cs-134."
